{"unit_id":"flying4055__dsh-window-bounds#card-zh","repo":"flying4055/dsh-window-bounds","commit":"a3ef65be5835a7fa618613cac718ae1fcd124850","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-window-bounds 是供 DSH 桌面端使用的窗口状态插件。它通过 webserver 的 index-inject 事件，在页面应用启动前注入脚本，从 localStorage 恢复上次的窗口尺寸和位置，并在调整窗口后防抖保存。它会按当前显示器工作区校验尺寸和坐标，过小或失效的位置不会被恢复；尺寸会缩小以适应工作区。可配置是否记忆位置、尺寸下限、保存延迟和诊断 trace。适合希望桌面窗口在重启后回到常用布局的用户；无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:227-264"]}
{"unit_id":"flying4055__dsh-window-bounds#card-en","repo":"flying4055/dsh-window-bounds","commit":"a3ef65be5835a7fa618613cac718ae1fcd124850","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-window-bounds remembers DSH desktop window size and position between launches. An injected script restores saved bounds and saves changes after a delay. It checks the current display area and supports size, position, and trace options. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:227-264"]}
