{"unit_id":"flying4055__dsh-window-bounds#feature-f1","repo":"flying4055/dsh-window-bounds","commit":"a3ef65be5835a7fa618613cac718ae1fcd124850","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-window-bounds 的功能「窗口尺寸与位置记忆」：启动时从本机存储恢复上次窗口几何，并监听 resize 和 move 事件，在防抖延迟后保存新的尺寸与位置。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/script.js:44-60"]}
